# Greed's own agent: asked why a pod keeps crashing, it searches and reads
# the project, proposes a change you allow, and says what it checked. The
# model is scripted in the demo profile, so it records the same each time.
size 1280 800
hide
keys :
type open src/worker.rs
keys enter
wait-for ATTEMPTS
show
wait 1
keys space i n
wait 1
type Greed
wait 0.5
keys enter
wait 0.8
type project
wait 0.5
keys enter
wait 1.2
type The worker pod keeps crashing. Why?
wait 0.4
keys alt-enter
wait 6
shot agent-asks
keys enter
wait 6
shot agent
wait 1.5
